        "text": "Experimental setup. Datasets: CLINC150 (150 intents, long agent descriptions), HWU64 (64 intents, cross-domain ambiguity), MINDS14 (multilingual, 14 domains), SGD (multi-turn dialogue), and QCloud, an internal Tencent Cloud dataset with stronger domain coupling and more agent conflicts. Metrics are accuracy on single-agent datasets, F1 on multi-agent ones, and an end-to-end task success rate after refinement. Baselines are dynamic routers: GPT-5.1, Claude-4.5, DeepSeek-v3.1, ArcRouter and the Qwen3 family. The released model is Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507, fully fine-tuned with ms-swift on 8 GPUs for one epoch; for RL, samples whose 8 rollouts agree above τ = 0.6 are dropped as already learned, and initialisation from a Slerp-merged model was also tried.",
