      "content": "• Reasoning capability is a key factor for improving routing interpretability and robustness.\n• RL is an essential training stage that enhances recall while maintaining high precision.\n• The choice of RL initialization point is crucial; Slerp-based models offer stronger generalization\nand are less prone to entropy collapse during RL.\n5",
